  reply = Identify it, tighten it, test it. That order. Skip a step and you'll be back. Measure twice. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Squeak's a dry hinge nine times in ten. Drop of oil, forty cents. Measure twice. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Leaks come from the joint, not the pipe. Everyone replaces the pipe. Measure twice. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Loosen it, seat it properly, tighten it down. Most things break from being forced. Measure twice. [[MOOD: neutral]]
